1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,176
Speaking, task two. Card number 14. You are at an estate agency looking for a flat to rent. Ask four questions.

2
00:00:10,867 --> 00:00:14,499
You are at an estate agency. You are looking for a flat to rent.

3
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:18,195
Hello. What can I do for you?

4
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:26,100
Hello, do you have a 2+1 flat available?

5
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:28,300
Yes, we have a 2+1 flat available.

6
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:34,964
How much is the rent?

7
00:00:35,167 --> 00:00:37,124
The rent is 14,000 crowns.

8
00:00:42,333 --> 00:00:44,067
When can I come for a viewing?

9
00:00:44,267 --> 00:00:45,857
A viewing is possible tomorrow.

10
00:00:51,067 --> 00:00:52,133
Can I have a dog?

11
00:00:52,333 --> 00:00:54,267
The owner will allow a small dog.

12
00:00:54,467 --> 00:00:57,467
Thanks for the information. Goodbye.

13
00:00:57,667 --> 00:00:58,819
Goodbye.

14
00:00:59,033 --> 00:01:08,254
Practise card 14 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
